# Text normalisation only. Deliberately NO `filter=lfs` entries: Images/ and
# Models/ are already committed as plain blobs, and declaring an LFS filter
# over extensions that exist as plain objects makes checkout fail outright on
# any machine without git-lfs installed. Large-asset policy is enforced by the
# repo-weight check in CI instead, which needs nothing installed locally.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mov binary
*.npz binary
